mainuan-welcome (1.0) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Prepare the first official Mainuan Welcome release with the validated
    native Qt/Plasma features, restricted installer and existing resources.
  * Adopt official version 1.0 intentionally below the experimental 2.3.1.x
    builds; preserve their history and document the explicit Debian downgrade.
  * Update official repository metadata and document installation/maintenance.
  * Add Ubuntu 26.04 CI with complete tests, Debian artifact validation and
    checksums; publish releases only for existing matching version tags.
  * Isolate native tests on private D-Bus sessions without service activation
    so appearance fixtures complete under debhelper's temporary runtime.
    Check all suites sequentially and in parallel before packaging in CI.
  * Keep external package consent concise while retaining technical diagnostics
    and all existing download, verification and authentication safeguards.
  * Open the independent Mainuan driver manager through its stable executable,
    without a version dependency or fallback to other driver tools.

 -- ruscher <rruscher@gmail.com>  Sat, 17 Oct 2026 23:15:00 -0300

